  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0 — Adds OAuth Token Configuration for API authentication. Browser-side:\n      configure OAuth2 client_credentials or password grant token acquisition per Environment on the\n      Config screen; Remote API profiles can opt in (RemoteApiProfile.remoteUseOAuthToken) to use the\n      acquired token instead of a static Bearer token, and requests block rather than silently fall back\n      if a token cannot be acquired. Server-side: new RemoteApiProfileOAuth (TokenEndpointUrl, ClientId,\n      ClientSecret) on RemoteApiProfile.OAuth lets the server acquire and cache a client_credentials\n      token itself — the client secret and token never reach the browser; only a redacted\n      remoteOAuthConfigured flag is exposed via /api-test-spark/config. See CHANGELOG.md for full\n      history.",
